# LaTeX build products
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.bbl
*.blg
*.synctex.gz

# Robustness analysis: results, figures and the report's build are generated by the scripts
# (run_all.sh), so only the code and the .tex are tracked, and the report's own figures
# (report/figs/: the PDFs the plotting scripts write there, paths.save_figure) so that it builds
# from the repository alone; the first analysis' reports are kept as PDFs (old_report/: their
# code and data are gone from the tree).
*.npz
*.png
*.pdf
!old_report/**/*.pdf
!report/figs/*.pdf
!report/figs/*.png
old_report/**/figs/
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.toc
